WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.280 --> 00:00:03.380
Do you have trouble with the edge stitches

2
00:00:03.410 --> 00:00:06.490
dropping when using your
Brother lace carriage?

3
00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:09.500
There's a little known and undocumented

4
00:00:09.530 --> 00:00:14.420
adjustment to the lace carriage
that controls end-needle selection.

5
00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:19.620
Turn your lace carriage over
and examine the pink lace cams.

6
00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:23.020
Be sure the slot
in the screw is vertical.

7
00:00:23.050 --> 00:00:26.620
This will prevent the machine
from selecting the edge needles.

8
00:00:26.650 --> 00:00:31.420
And the lace carriage will not
attempt to transfer that edge-stitch.

9
00:00:31.450 --> 00:00:33.000
No more dropped edge-stitches.

